w carefully examining the user\'s requirements. They\'ve emphasized the need for an admin panel for content control and news management. The plan will need to include feature prioritization, feature definition, in-scope/out-of-scope aspects, and clear Supabase integration for authorization and database. I have also eliminated irrelevant skills.\n\n\n"
