  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating App.tsx Issue**\n\nOkay, I\'m focusing on why `App.tsx` might be empty, despite the screenshot. I\'m trying to connect the user\'s statement about building a news website with the empty file. The user mentioned they just finished the website design and now want to make the website build. I\'m looking for the missing pieces.\n\n\n**Defining Missing Features**\n\nI realize I need to determine missing features based on the website\'s description. The user wants me to identify what\'s absent, specifically an admin panel. A plan is needed for core functionalities before implementation. I\'m prioritizing outlining essential elements \342\200\223 what to include and exclude \342\200\223 to guide the development process. Is an application design provided, or are we working from scratch?\n\n\n**Prioritizing Planning Needs**\n\nOkay, I\'m now clear: the user is prioritizing a plan. My focus shifts to constructing a plan, confirming essential features, and deciding what needs to be included in the landing page, and what should be reserved for the admin panel they requested. I will need to ensure we account for the empty `App.tsx` file for the preview; it should be more than an empty screen for the user.\n\n\n**Outlining Project Implementation**\n\nI\'m now outlining the project implementation, considering the Supabase account for the server. I will define the missing pieces and prioritize planning. I also realize I need to build trust; I will populate `src/App.tsx` with a high-fidelity news portal UI matching the design, showcasing the categories, and using client-side state and local storage for a functional demo. Furthermore, a planning document or the admin portal design will be created.\n\n\n**Implementing Admin Panel Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the admin features using local memory, allowing draft creation, article editing, deletion, and comment management with placeholders for Supabase. This fully integrates with the frontend high-fidelity UI. I will also be creating a detailed, professional roadmap including database schemas, authorization structures, and instructions.\n\n\n**Designing News Portal Layout**\n\nI\'m now designing the news portal layout based on the provided requirements. I\'m focusing on the logo \"Samachar Plus\" in maroon on white and the main navbar with categories like \"\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277\" and \"\340\244\256\340\244\250\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\250\". I will include the dark/light theme toggle, search, and a hero grid with a big headline card with a category badge and an image. I will ensure the news links are implemented correctly.\n\n\n**Constructing Layout Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the news portal\'s RHS column and the \"\340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 (International)\" section. The right-hand side will feature a \"\340\244\244\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\274\340\244\276 \340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\241\340\245\207\340\244\237\" header with cards for articles and ad blocks. I\'m building out cards with headlines and images for current events. Under \"\340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 (International),\" I\'m populating a section with cards detailing articles from May 20, 2024.\n\n\n**Populating World News Section**\n\nI\'m now populating the \"\340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 (International)\" section with recent news articles. I\'m focusing on article headlines and dates from May 17-19, 2024: \"\340\244\227\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\213\340\244\254\340\244\262 \340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\227 \340\244\252\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\244\202\340\244\257\340\245\201\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\244 \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\245\215\340\244\260 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\227\340\244\202\340\244\255\340\245\200\340\244\260 \340\244\232\340\245\207\340\244\244\340\244\276\340\244\265\340\244\250\340\245\200,\" \"\340\244\205\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\232\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\265\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\206\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\277\340\244\253\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\262 \340\244\207\340\244\202\340\244\237\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\270 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\255\340\245\202\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260 \340\244\232\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\232\340\244\276,\" and \"\340\244\257\340\245\202\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\252 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\206\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\244\277\340\244\225 \340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\227\340\244\244: \340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\245\207\340\244\267\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\257.\" I\'m also preparing to add an ad banner and the \"\340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260\" section. I will include video titles like \"\340\244\225\340\245\207\340\244\246\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\245 \340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\244\340\245\210\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\257\340\244\234\340\244\276\" and \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244\340\245\200\340\244\257 \340\244\257\340\245\201\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\223\340\244\202 \340\244\250\340\245\207 \340\244\254\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\244\254\340\244\270\340\245\207 \340\244\233\340\245\213\340\244\237\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\245\210\340\244\237\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\207\340\244\237\" with play overlays.\n\n\n**Adding News Article Details**\n\nI\'m now adding details to the \"\340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\244\276\340\244\250 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\245\215\340\244\257\" section with new cards and news articles. I\'m including article titles with headlines and dates like \"\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\225\340\245\210\340\244\202\340\244\270\340\244\260 \340\244\245\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\252\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\262 \340\244\237\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\257\340\244\262 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\250\340\244\244\340\245\200\340\244\234\340\245\207 \340\244\211\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\271\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\244\225\" and \"\340\244\232\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\250-4 \340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\250 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\244\340\245\210\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\266\340\245\201\340\244\260\340\245\202: \340\244\207\340\244\270 \340\244\254\340\244\276\340\244\260 \340\244\262\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\267\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\271\340\245\210 \340\244\270\340\245\210\340\244\202\340\244\252\340\244\262 \340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\244\276.\" The articles feature brief descriptions as well.\n\n\n**Formatting News Articles**\n\nI\'m formatting recent news items for the portal\'s grid: \"\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237 \340\244\270\340\244\277\340\244\237\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\250,\" \"IPL 2024,\" \"\340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\267\340\244\276 \340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277,\" \"5G-A Network,\" \"Laapataa Ladies,\" \"Dehydration Tips,\" \"Old Delhi Food,\" and \"Dubai Tourism.\" My goal is a compelling display. I\'m focusing on concise presentation and impactful headlines for each article.\n\n\n**Compiling News Headlines**\n\nI\'m now compiling additional news headlines for the portal\'s content. This includes: \"\340\244\205\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\247\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276: \340\244\255\340\244\265\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\256 \340\244\256\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\244\277\340\244\260,\" \"\340\244\256\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\244\266\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\260\340\244\243: \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244\340\245\200\340\244\257 \340\244\250\340\245\214\340\244\270\340\245\207\340\244\250\340\244\276,\" \"\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\205\340\244\252 \340\244\207\340\244\202\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276: \340\244\254\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\227\340\244\262\340\245\201\340\244\260\340\245\201 \340\244\225\340\244\202\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200,\" \"\340\244\252\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\265\340\244\260\340\244\243: \340\244\227\340\244\202\340\244\227\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\244\253\340\244\276\340\244\210 \340\244\205\340\244\255\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\250,\" and \"\340\244\237\340\245\202\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\256: \340\244\256\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\245\200 \340\244\254\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\253\340\244\254\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200.\" I\'m aiming for a mix of relevant articles.\n\n\n**Designing App Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating new headlines into the news portal\'s display: \"\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200\340\244\252 \340\244\217\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\276\340\244\260?\" and A.R. Rahman\'s new single. I\'m also including headlines on nature, career guidance in the AI era, and footer details. The design plan includes a functional light/dark mode, a search feature, and a detailed article view. Finally, I will add an admin panel button.\n\n\n**Aligning Typography Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on aligning typography, which the guidelines stress is critical. I\'ll ensure all text elements, from article headlines to body copy, adhere to the specified style. I need to implement the Admin Panel, including article creation/editing/deletion. It uses local storage initialized with existing items for immediate editability. The admin interface includes stats and an authentication screen.\n\n\n**Selecting Font Choices**\n\nI\'m now selecting fonts, focusing on conveying the right \"vibe.\" I\'m choosing Inter as the primary sans-serif font for general UI. I\'ll consider Space Grotesk or Outfit for display headings, or Playfair Display for an editorial feel. JetBrains Mono or Fira Code are good options for technical data. I\'m adding Google Fonts links in `index.html` after checking the `metadata.json` file.\n\n\n**Updating Metadata Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the metadata. I\'ve updated `metadata.json` with the name \"Samachar Plus\" and added the description: \"A professional, high-fidelity Hindi News Website with dynamic content control and admin panel.\" I\'m also preparing to update `index.html` to integrate Google Fonts and Tailwind, while simultaneously considering the Supabase installation for the backend.\n\n\n**Implementing Supabase Setup**\n\nI\'m now implementing `@supabase/supabase-js`, preparing for seamless integration. The utility `src/lib/supabase.ts` will dynamically initialize Supabase based on the presence of credentials in `.env` for robustness. I\'ll handle missing API keys gracefully and use lazy initialization to avoid crashing the application, a gorgeous implementation.\n\n\n"
