  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Static Data**\n\nI\'m now focused on constructing the unified static data within `src/data.ts`. This involves meticulously representing the content from the \"Samachar Plus\" screenshot, including all 20+ news items, their corresponding headers, and accurate categorization across politics, local news, world news, entertainment, videos, and science/health. This detailed data will form the foundation of this project.\n\n\n**Compiling Hindi Content**\n\nI\'m now focusing on compiling the content. For example, the politics main article, \"\340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\252\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\267 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\256\340\244\271\340\244\276-\340\244\227\340\244\240\340\244\254\340\244\202\340\244\247\340\244\250: \340\244\246\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\276\340\244\262 \340\244\260\340\245\210\340\244\262\340\245\200, 2024 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\232\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\265 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\254\340\244\277\340\244\227\340\245\201\340\244\262 \340\244\253\340\245\202\340\244\202\340\244\225\340\244\276,\" is complete with its image, and categorization. The articles themselves will all be in Hindi/Sanskrit, just like in the screenshot. I\'ll load them as initial data into local storage.\n\n\n**Implementing Image Loading**\n\nI\'m now implementing high-quality fallback images from Unsplash to ensure the news items render beautifully. I want to make sure the images load correctly. I am also working on adding the other articles in the screenshot, including categorization and time stamps. For example, \"\340\244\266\340\245\207\340\244\257\340\244\260 \340\244\254\340\244\276\340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\260 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\227\340\244\277\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\265\340\244\237, \340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\265\340\245\207\340\244\266\340\244\225\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\241\340\245\202\340\244\254\340\245\207 \340\244\225\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\260\340\245\201\340\244\252\340\244\257\340\245\207\" can be categorized as politics, since it is a broad news topic.\n\n\n**Adding New Article Data**\n\nI\'m now incorporating several new articles with their details. \"\340\244\205\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\232\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\265\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\206\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\277\340\244\253\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\262 \340\244\207\340\244\202\340\244\237\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\270 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\255\340\245\202\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260 \340\244\232\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\232\340\244\276\" and \"\340\244\257\340\245\202\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\252 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\250\340\244\210 \340\244\206\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\244\277\340\244\225 \340\244\250\340\245\200\340\244\244\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\227\340\244\244: \340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\245\207\340\244\267\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\257\" are being added, along with their dates. I am also working on categorizing the video news items such as \"\340\244\227\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\211\340\244\202\340\244\241 \340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\252\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\237: \340\244\225\340\245\207\340\244\246\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\245 \340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\244\340\245\210\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\257\340\244\234\340\244\276\", along with the duration and categorizations. The \"\340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\244\276\340\244\250 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\245\215\340\244\257\" section\'s data is also being added.\n\n\n**Adding Science and Tech**\n\nI\'m now integrating science and technology articles. I\'ve added \"\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\252\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\245\200\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\244\262 \340\244\237\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\276\340\244\257\340\244\262 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\250\340\244\244\340\245\200\340\244\234\340\245\207 \340\244\211\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\271\340\244\234\340\244\250\340\244\225,\" dated May 18, 2024, focusing on a new technique targeting affected cells. I\'ve also included \"\340\244\232\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\250-4 \340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\266\340\244\250 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\244\340\245\210\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\266\340\245\201\340\244\260\340\245\202,\" dated May 17, 2024, detailing ISRO\'s plans to bring back samples by 2027. I\'m also adding the twenty other articles from \"\340\244\205\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\256\340\245\201\340\244\226 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202 (\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\244\277\340\2