  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing the Admin Panel**\n\nI\'m now focusing on creating the `AdminPanel.tsx` component. I\'ve already established the foundation with `PlanningView.tsx` and `ArticleDetail.tsx`. My current focus is figuring out the ideal structure and look of this central admin control dashboard.\n\n\n**Designing the Admin Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now integrating login access, offering preset credentials for initial interaction while allowing Supabase Auth setup later. The dashboard\'s taking shape with key stats: total articles, views, video vs. article count, and category breakdown. I\'ve built in database configuration fields for Supabase URL and Public Anon Key, which are saved to localStorage for testing flexibility. Finally, I\'m implementing a filterable article list with search, breaking news, and category options, alongside edit and delete operations.\n\n\n**Designing the Article Form**\n\nI\'m now deeply immersed in the details of the article creation/edit form. My focus is on the data structure: I\'m meticulously crafting input fields for title, content, image URL, category selection, and author data, including a sensible default for the author. I\'ve included breaking news and video options with conditional video duration entry, and also clear submission buttons. The goal is to make it clean, functional, and visually appealing, consistent with design standards.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 49
      nanos: 504433858
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
