    thinking: "**Constructing The Foundation**\n\nOkay, I\'ve successfully constructed the fundamental files: `src/types.ts`, `src/data.ts`, `src/lib/supabase.ts`, `src/components/PlanningView.tsx`, `src/components/ArticleDetail.tsx`, and `src/components/AdminPanel.tsx`. Now, let\'s figure out the next steps.\n\n\n**Designing The App**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the core landing page in `src/App.tsx`. My current focus is to implement light/dark theme support, a top marquee banner for breaking news, and a sticky main header with a menu drawer button for mobile. I\'m leveraging Tailwind for a high-contrast design. I\'m considering using either local state to toggle a dark mode CSS class or standard class elements.\n\n\n**Implementing Core Functionality**\n\nI\'m now integrating the search button toggle and dark/light mode toggle. A clean Settings or Shield icon button will initiate access to the admin dashboard, next to the search/theme toggle. It\'s a nice, simple implementation, or I could place it in the footer. I\'m focusing on the \"politics\" section, specifically the hero banner grid. It\'ll display highlighted news with an overlay and a description.\n\n\n**Adding New Sections**\n\nI\'ve added the \"\340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 (International)\" section, displaying four cards with a zoom effect. I also incorporated a large leaderboard ad banner and the \"\340\244\265\340\245\200\340\244\241\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\245\213 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260\" (Video News) section with three interactive video cards. Finally, I\'m working on the \"\340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\234\340\245\215\340\244\236\340\244\276\340\244\250 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\245\215\340\244\257\" (Science & Health) section and the \"\340\244\205\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\257 \340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\256\340\245\201\340\244\226 \340\244\226\340\244\254\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\202 (\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276)\" (Recent Stories Grid), focusing on dynamic content and category filtering, all pulling from the data source and admin input.\n\n\n**Refining Interaction & Details**\n\nI\'m now implementing automatic filtering! Clicking a category will scroll to the relevant section or filter the feed. This ensures a smooth user experience. The `ArticleDetail` modal mounts seamlessly when the `selectedArticleId` is set, enhancing the detail view. Finally, I\'ve created a comprehensive footer with brand details and links to terms, and an admin launch panel. I\'m focusing on ensuring everything is real, interactive, and aesthetically pleasing and I\'m reviewing `tsconfig.json` to be sure there are no path resolution issues.\n\n\n"
