  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Clarifying App Logic**\n\nI\'m now focused on translating the application\'s logic into English for clarity. I\'m aiming to articulate the underlying design choices and explain the Hindi elements. This is a crucial step towards ensuring a comprehensive understanding of the app\'s functionality for all users. The focus is now on conveying the application\'s essence effectively.\n\n\n**Reviewing Information Delivery**\n\nI\'ve shifted my attention to information delivery. My focus is now on ensuring concise and jargon-free explanations, as per the guidelines. I am avoiding technical justifications unless explicitly requested. I am now double-checking my approach to maintain clarity and professionalism in my responses, with a goal of friendly and objective assistance.\n\n\n**Defining App Functionality**\n\nI\'m now detailing Samachar Plus\'s core features. It\'s a dynamic Hindi news portal with categorized updates. I\'m highlighting the dual-database architecture, which gracefully handles Supabase initialization and falls back to a local storage database if needed. I am ensuring that the description concisely reflects the application\'s robust design and operational features.\n\n\n**Detailing Functionality Features**\n\nI\'m now detailing the application\'s additional features. The app is populated with 23 dynamic rich news articles and real reader comment logs. I\'m focusing on the implementation of responsive design with dark mode, a global marquee banner, and clean typography. The interactive video news section with play indicators will also be highlighted. I\'m also ensuring to include a mention of the Light/Dark theme toggle.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented **Samachar Plus (\340\244\270\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 \340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\244\270)**, a high-fidelity, fully responsive Hindi news portal and Content Management System (CMS). Here is a complete overview in English of what has been crafted and set up:\n\n### \360\237\214\237 Key App Features\n\n- **Pristine Responsive Layout**: Formatted with clean typography pairings (Inter for UI elements, Be Vietnam Pro for readability in Hindi news bodies, and Poppins for display headings). It features a fluid responsive layout, a global animated flash-news ticker, an interactive video section with customized overlay play triggers, and a seamless **Light/Dark theme toggle**.\n- **Interactive News Lightbox**: Readers can click on any news article to open a detailed view containing:\n  - Precise metrics (publishing dates, authors, and real-time read trackers).\n  - An interactive **Comment Section** where users can leave localized opinions, stored directly under the article.\n  - Quick share tools, including an instant **WhatsApp sharing utility** that builds custom message snippets and a **Copy Link** clipboard action.\n- **Search System**: A modern, high-speed overlay search matching titles, descriptions, context keyword terms, or author names instantly.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Hybrid Storage & Architecture (Crash-Safe Controller)\n\nTo prevent runtime failures if database parameters are not set up, the application employs a highly resilient **Unified newsService Controller**:\n1. **Supabase Cloud Sync**: The system checks for environment configurations or custom-saved administrator keys. If present, it reads and updates articles and reader reviews live to your backend database.\n2. **Local Storage Fallback**: If the server is unconfigured or offline, it gracefully falls back to a fully integrated Local Storage database. This ensures the entire application remains interactive, pre-populated with **23 rich, categorized news stories** ready for readers to engage with.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\224\221 Secure Admin Control Console & CMS\n\nBy clicking the **\340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\266\340\244\276\340\244\270\340\244\225 (Admin)** key in the navigation bar, administrators can access a secure management backend:\n- **Authorization Guard**: Locked behind a pristine login modal requiring the demo password **`admin123`** to access.\n- **Live Status & Metrics Dashboard**: Displays aggregated analytics including total views, categorized count meters, total breaking reports, and a progress breakout showing the distribution of reports across different sections.\n- **Full Editorial Suite (CRUD)**: Authorized administrators can draft new stories, insert Unsplash cover images, tag reports as \"Breaking News\" or \"Video Clips\" with adjustable video lengths, edit text content, or delete outdated articles instantly.\n- **Credentials Integrator**: Dynamically save custom Supabase URLs and Anon keys straight from the control interface. These settings persist instantly to connect the portal directly to your host database.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\223\213 Interactive Supabase Migration Plan & SQL Library\n\nWithin the Admin Panel is the **Supabase Blueprint**, which displays a step-by-step English migration sequence and a pre-formatted SQL schema library ready for deployment:\n1. **Articles Table Schema**: Complete SQL code set up with proper types and Row Level Security (RLS) policies allowing the public to read and admins to create, write, or modify.\n2. **Comments Table Schema**: Clean script configuring relational foreign key comments with public submit permissions and private deletion controls."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 762146574
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
